{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-48","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-48-talk-403815272-line","text":"这是你来到星际和平公司的第一天。你望着高耸入云的星际和平分部大楼，决心成为一名出色的星际和平员工。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-48-talk-403815273-line","text":"你骄傲地挺起了胸膛！你胸前的「P-13」级别标识在太阳下闪闪发光，不，「P-13」怎可定义你？你的*野心*可远不止于此……","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-48-text-3242947733431129815-choice","text":"将下班时间献给琥珀王。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-48-text-10537880697732250833-choice","text":"精准地寻找目标销售星系。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-48-text-7099716089862969418-choice","text":"敷衍地售卖「星际和平杂货」。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-48-text-4929902692711988887-choice","text":"悄悄偷懒。","speaker":""}]}
